  "notes": "Found on 2026-11-22 by a sampling search over the cyclic group Z_89. The skew first block is fixed in advance and is invariant under the multiplier group of order 11; rows of the other three blocks whose periodic autocorrelations lie in fixed windows form three pools, and the pools are joined exactly. This is a sample and not a census. The Goethals-Seidel matrix of these rows is a skew-Hadamard matrix of order 356. That order is the smallest one listed as undecided in the second source and is the first open order of baselines/skew-gaps.json. A search of current sources on 2026-11-22 found no earlier skew-Hadamard matrix of order 356; that is a report of the search, not a proof of priority, and the result has not been reviewed."
